---@alias paypal.customer_disputes_v1.TrackingInfoList paypal.customer_disputes_v1.TrackingInfo[]

---The information about the disputed transaction.
---@class paypal.customer_disputes_v1.TransactionInfo
---@field buyer_transaction_id? string The ID, as seen by the customer, for this transaction.
---@field seller_transaction_id? string The ID, as seen by the merchant, for this transaction.
---@field reference_id? string The ID, as seen by the partner, for this transaction.
---@field create_time? string The date and time when the transaction was created, in [Internet date and time format](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3339#section-5.6). For example, *`yyyy`*-*`MM`*-*`dd`*`T`*`HH`*:*`mm`*:*`ss`*.*`SSS`*`Z`.
---@field transaction_status? paypal.customer_disputes_v1.TransactionInfoTransactionStatus The transaction status.
---@field gross_amount? paypal.customer_disputes_v1.Money The gross amount of the transaction.
---@field gross_asset? paypal.customer_disputes_v1.Cryptocurrency The gross asset of the transaction.
---@field invoice_number? string The ID of the invoice for the payment.
---@field custom? string A free-text field that is entered by the merchant during checkout.
---@field buyer? paypal.customer_disputes_v1.Buyer
---@field seller? paypal.customer_disputes_v1.Seller
---@field items? paypal.customer_disputes_v1.ItemInfoList
---@field payment_processor? any

---An array of transactions for which disputes were created.
---@alias paypal.customer_disputes_v1.TransactionInfoList paypal.customer_disputes_v1.TransactionInfo[]

---The transaction status.
---@alias paypal.customer_disputes_v1.TransactionInfoTransactionStatus "COMPLETED"|"UNCLAIMED"|"DENIED"|"FAILED"|"HELD"|"PENDING"|"PARTIALLY_REFUNDED"|"REFUNDED"|"REVERSED"|"CANCELLED"

